 	\end{equation}
 	and symmetrically with the registers $\mathrm{A}\mathrm{A}'$ in place of $\mathrm{B}\mathrm{B}'$. (If $d = 0$, every element of $\mathrm{ideg}_{d,m}(\F_q)$ is constant, hence an encoding, and the left-hand side vanishes.)

